<title>POLAND: BWR Q3 net jumps to PLN 1.1 mln.</title>
<headline>BWR Q3 net jumps to PLN 1.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BWR results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.14    vs   1.37</p>
<p>    net					1.08    vs   0.35</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  2.14    vs   1.37</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej SA. </p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.01    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   2.66    vs   1.75</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   23.15    vs  14.62</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	16.41    vs  10.85</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.61    vs   0.33</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.06    vs   1.02</p>
<p>JANUARY - SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.44    vs   3.54</p>
<p>    net					3.95    vs   1.81</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  5.44    vs   3.54</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.01    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   7.47    vs   4.68</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   65.06    vs  38.27</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	46.41    vs  27.81</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  1.55    vs   0.84</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.49    vs   1.73</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
